aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{1}{5}&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{5}} \\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "e73fcff5-96f0-50ba-ade3-485d0e837c29" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e73fcff5-96f0-50ba-ade3-485d0e837c29" :question/answer-fields "263081b9-c098-5296-b3ba-ccbd6cff89a0"] [:db/ensure "e73fcff5-96f0-50ba-ade3-485d0e837c29" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "e73fcff5-96f0-50ba-ade3-485d0e837c29"] [:db/add "21db5c44-fcb8-5b01-9b1d-ac8e88a5f892" :answer/id #uuid "21db5c44-fcb8-5b01-9b1d-ac8e88a5f892"] [:db/add "21db5c44-fcb8-5b01-9b1d-ac8e88a5f892" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "21db5c44-fcb8-5b01-9b1d-ac8e88a5f892" :answer/value "- \\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "21db5c44-fcb8-5b01-9b1d-ac8e88a5f892" :answer/validate] [:db/add "03395a53-175c-5f94-85c1-2133aad794e3" :answer/id #uuid "03395a53-175c-5f94-85c1-2133aad794e3"] [:db/add "03395a53-175c-5f94-85c1-2133aad794e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "03395a53-175c-5f94-85c1-2133aad794e3" :answer/value "- \\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "03395a53-175c-5f94-85c1-2133aad794e3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6960633b-2ea7-53fd-9958-8e8833d6ba38" :answer/id #uuid "6960633b-2ea7-53fd-9958-8e8833d6ba38"] [:db/add "6960633b-2ea7-53fd-9958-8e8833d6ba38" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6960633b-2ea7-53fd-9958-8e8833d6ba38" :answer/value "- \\frac{6}{5}\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db